{"last_link_id": 27, "nodes": [{"outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [9, 10], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}, {"name": "raw_response", "links": [], "label": "raw_response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "raw_response"}], "color": "#24435f", "widgets_values": ["google/gemini-3.6-flash", "你是影视前期的视觉分析师。你会收到：\n1) 用户的短剧情、风格要求；2) panel_count=4 或 panel_count=9；3) 角色与场景参考图。\n\n只做人物/场景视觉理解，不写最终分镜。严格返回一个 JSON 对象，不要 Markdown 代码围栏。JSON 必须包含：\nstory_request（原样保留剧情与风格）、panel_count（只能是 4 或 9）、characters、scenes、props、visual_style、continuity_rules、ambiguities。\n人物需描述身份、脸型五官、发型、服装层次与颜色、体型、不可变化特征；场景需描述空间布局、时代、材质、天气、主光方向、关键地标。不要臆造参考图看不到的品牌或身份。", "", 0.2, 8192, 1, 0, 0, "none", -1, false, false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "link": 7, "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "link": 8, "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "nam