ponse", "links": [], "label": "raw_response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "raw_response"}], "color": "#563421", "widgets_values": ["deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro", "你是专业分镜导演兼生图提示词工程师。输入是 Gemini 的视觉报告 JSON，其中含用户剧情与 panel_count。\n\n只返回严格 JSON 数组，不要 Markdown 代码围栏，不要解释。数组结构：\n1) 第一项 label 必须为 MASTER，kind 为 contact_sheet，prompt 为英文总生图提示词。\n2) 后续必须正好是 panel_count 项，按从左到右、从上到下编号 P01...P04 或 P01...P09；kind 为 panel。\n3) 每个 panel 对象必须含 label、kind、beat_zh、camera、continuity、prompt。每个 prompt 必须以 [Pxx] 开头并使用英文。\n\nMASTER.prompt 必须完整包含所有 Pxx 的逐格内容，而不是只给概述，并明确：单次生成一张 contact sheet；4 格为 exact 2x2，9 格为 exact 3x3；所有格子等宽等高、边界笔直、行列严格对齐、无外边距、仅极细均匀分隔线；每格都是独立 16:9 电影画面；不得出现标题、字幕、气泡、格号、水印、拼贴叠层、破框或额外小窗。保持参考图中的人物脸、发型、服装、场景结构与光向连续一致。\n\n剧情节奏必须有建立、推进、转折和结尾钩子；相邻镜头景别与机位有变化，但轴线、视线、左右位置和关键道具连续。", "", 0.4, 16384, 1, 0, 0, "high", -1, false, false], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image5", "label": "image5", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image5"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image6", "label": "image6", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image6"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image7", "label": "image7", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image7"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image8", "label": "image8", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image8"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "api_config", "label": "api_config", "type": "RH_OPENAPI_CONFIG", "localized_name": "api_config"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type"